<title>POLAND: Polish Stomil Sanok wants bourse debut on Jan 16.</title>
<headline>Polish Stomil Sanok wants bourse debut on Jan 16.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish rubber producer Stomil Sanik SA wants to enter the Warsaw Stock Exchange on January 16, the company said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>It said it applied to the bourse for the first listing of its 5.2 million shares on the main market of the exchange on January 16.</p>
<p>In the heavily oversubscribed November initial public offering Stomil sold 500,000 new shares at 25 zlotys per share.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
